//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////*/

/// @dev `BaseStrategy` (the abstract parent of `BaseHealthCheck`) follows the
/// Yearn tokenized-strategy pattern: the strategy contract's `TokenizedStrategy`
/// member points at `address(this)`, and any call whose selector isn't defined
/// directly on the strategy falls through to a `fallback()` that `delegatecall`s
/// into the logic contract deployed at `_tokenizedStrategyAddress`, executing in
/// the strategy's own storage. This mock is that logic contract: it stores
